OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of May puffin numbers plummet
OL,4,Aafter extreme weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FPuffin numbers in one of the UK's
OL,7,Flargest colonies have suffered after a
OL,8,Fdrop in food supplies and extreme
OL,9,Fweather conditions, conservationists
OL,10,Fhave warned.
OL,12,FNatureScot said the number of burrows
OL,13,Foccupied by the seabirds on the Isle of
OL,14,FMay in the Firth of Forth had fallen by
OL,15,F30% in the last two years.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
