OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of May puffin numbers plummet
OL,4,Aafter extreme weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA joint survey also involving the UK
OL,7,FCentre for Ecology & Hydrology (UKCEH)
OL,8,Fsuggested violent storms had killed a
OL,9,Fnumber of the birds, while rising ocean
OL,10,Ftemperatures had seriously harmed
OL,11,Fpopulations of sand eels - their main
OL,12,Fsource of food.
OL,14,FResearchers described the population
OL,15,Fdecline as "disappointing and
OL,16,Fconcerning".
